--- Logic & Comparison Operator Tester ---
--- Comparisons ---
a != b (TRUE): 1
a != 10 (FALSE): 0
a <= 10 (TRUE): 1
a <= 9 (FALSE): 0
a >= 10 (TRUE): 1
a >= 11 (FALSE): 0
a < b (TRUE): 1
b > a (TRUE): 1
--- Logic ---
t AND t (TRUE): 1
t AND f (FALSE): 0
f AND f (FALSE): 0
t OR t (TRUE): 1
t OR f (TRUE): 1
f OR f (FALSE): 0
NOT t (FALSE): 0
NOT f (TRUE): 1
--- Complex Logic ---
f OR t AND t (TRUE): 1
(a < b) AND (b > 15) (TRUE): 1
